 r←Test_Menubar_996(stopFlag batchFlag);menu2;TheForm;parms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Passes a menu definition that uses ∆ and ⍙ in names.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 'TheForm'⎕WC'Form'('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(35 45))('Size'(300 400))
 :Trap 0
     n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Menubar.Create TheForm MenuNamesWith∆And⍙ ⍬(⎕NEW #._APLGUI.GUI.KeyCodes)
